@architecture.hexagonal

Purpose:
  Ports and adapters, dependency inversion.

UseWhen:
  - need high testability
  - want framework independence
  - complex domain logic

AvoidWhen:
  - very simple CRUD
  - team unfamiliar with DDD

Why:
  Domain is isolated from external concerns.

TradeOffs:
  + Highly testable
  + Framework agnostic
  - More initial structure
  - Learning curve

Related:
  @architecture.layered
  @architecture.clean
  @patterns.repository

Examples:
  @project.payment
  @project.order

State: +
